Package: machineryR
Title: State-Machine Workflow Orchestration for Ontology-Based Processes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Cathal", "Byrne", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "cathal@example.com")
  )
Description: Define multi-step workflows as state machines over ontology object types.
    Transitions are triggered by actions, automated conditions, or human approval.
    Tracks per-instance workflow state, enforces ordering, handles retries, and
    surfaces bottlenecks in a process dashboard.
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
